### 5. Test Files Created

#### [e2e/tests/auth.spec.ts](file:///d:/cogtics%20main/Tech/e2e/tests/auth.spec.ts)

**Coverage:**
- Application loading
- Dashboard navigation
- Navigation menu validation
- Tenant isolation enforcement
- API authentication validation

**Key Tests:**
```typescript
test('should enforce tenant isolation', async ({ page, request }) => {
  const response = await request.get('http://localhost:3000/api/issues', {
    headers: { 'x-tenant-id': 'invalid-tenant-id' }
  });
  expect([401, 403]).toContain(response.status());
});
```

#### [e2e/tests/upload-workflow.spec.ts](file:///d:/cogtics%20main/Tech/e2e/tests/upload-workflow.spec.ts)

**Coverage:**
- CSV file upload
- Error handling for invalid files
- Upload progress indication

**Key Tests:**
```typescript
test('should upload CSV file successfully', async ({ page }) => {
  await page.goto('/uploads');
  const fileInput = page.locator('input[type="file"]');
  await fileInput.setInputFiles('test-upload.csv');
  
  const successMessage = page.getByText(/uploaded successfully/i);
  await expect(successMessage).toBeVisible({ timeout: 30000 });
});
```

#### [e2e/tests/detection-workflow.spec.ts](file:///d:/cogtics%20main/Tech/e2e/tests/detection-workflow.spec.ts)

**Coverage:**
- Issues page navigation
- Issues list display
- Severity filtering
- Issue detail viewing
- Detection API endpoint
- AI analysis panel

**Key Tests:**
```typescript
test('should filter issues by severity', async ({ page }) => {
  await page.goto('/issues');
  const severityFilter = page.getByLabel(/severity/i);
  await severityFilter.click();
  await page.getByText(/critical/i).click();
  
  const url = page.url();
  expect(url.includes('severity') || url.includes('critical')).toBeTruthy();
});
```

